---
import Layout from '~/layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import HeroText from '~/components/widgets/HeroText.astro';

const metadata = { 
  title: 'Terms of Service | Hanei JP',
  description: 'The legal framework and service agreement for Hanei JP digital infrastructure projects.'
};
---
<Layout metadata={metadata}>
  <HeroText title="Terms of Service" subtitle="Last Updated: April 2026" />
  
  <section class="px-4 py-12 sm:px-6 mx-auto lg:py-20 max-w-4xl">
    <div class="prose prose-lg dark:prose-invert max-w-none text-muted dark:text-slate-400">
      
      <h2 class="text-slate-900 dark:text-white">1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
      <p>By engaging Hanei JP ("The Studio") for website development, review systems, or digital infrastructure services, you ("The Client") agree to be bound by the following Terms of Service. These terms constitute a legally binding agreement between the Client and Hanei JP.</p>

      <h2 class="text-slate-900 dark:text-white">2. Scope of Services</h2>
      <p>Hanei JP provides boutique digital infrastructure services, including but not limited to:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>1-Page Business Websites:</strong> Rapid-deployment single-page sites.</li>
        <li><strong>Review Engine:</strong> Fully hosted automated review collection systems.</li>
        <li><strong>English Hanare:</strong> Detached English language hubs on sub-domains.</li>
        <li><strong>Grand Reform/NEW:</strong> Full website redesigns or new builds.</li>
        <li><strong>Community Mission:</strong> Free-of-charge development for registered NPOs.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="text-slate-900 dark:text-white">3. Payment & Fees</h2>
      <p>Hanei JP operates primarily on a <strong>CapEx (One-Time Investment)</strong> model. Unless explicitly stated otherwise in a custom service agreement:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>All payments are required in full prior to the commencement of development.</li>
        <li>Payments are processed securely via Stripe or PayPal.</li>
        <li><strong>No Monthly Fees:</strong> Core services do not carry recurring subscription costs.</li>
        <li><strong>Refund Policy:</strong> Due to the immediate allocation of resources and the custom nature of digital work, all payments are non-refundable once development has initiated.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="text-slate-900 dark:text-white">4. Delivery & Timelines</h2>
      <p>Hanei JP is committed to industry-leading delivery speeds (24-72 hours). However, the "Same Day" or "1-Business Day" guarantee is strictly contingent upon:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>The Client providing all necessary text, imagery, and branding assets by 12:00 PM JST.</li>
        <li>The Client’s prompt availability for final review and approval.</li>
        <li>Standard operational capacity. Hanei JP is not liable for delays caused by third-party infrastructure failures (e.g., DNS propagation, Registrar outages).</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="text-slate-900 dark:text-white">5. Client Obligations & Technical Access</h2>
      <p>Hanei JP operates a "Zero-Access" security model. The Client is responsible for:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Providing accurate business information and high-resolution media.</li>
        <li>Executing the "Website Address Record" (CNAME) update within their own domain registrar. Hanei JP will provide guidance but will never ask for or accept domain account credentials.</li>
        <li>Ensuring all provided content does not infringe on third-party intellectual property.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="text-slate-900 dark:text-white">6. Intellectual Property</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Client Content:</strong> The Client retains all rights to their original logos, trademarks, and provided text.</li>
        <li><strong>The Resulting Asset:</strong> Upon final payment, the Client owns the resulting website code and design.</li>
        <li><strong>Studio Logic:</strong> Hanei JP retains ownership of proprietary backend logic, server configurations, and automation scripts used to serve the asset.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="text-slate-900 dark:text-white">7. Limitation of Liability</h2>
      <p>Hanei JP builds infrastructure designed for maximum stability. However:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Hanei JP is not liable for any loss of revenue, data, or business standing resulting from the use of our services.</li>
        <li>We are not responsible for the policies or actions of third-party platforms such as Google Business Profiles, Instagram, or Stripe.</li>
        <li>In no event shall Hanei JP’s total liability exceed the actual amount paid by the Client for the specific project in question.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="text-slate-900 dark:text-white">8. Service Warranty</h2>
      <p>Every project includes <strong>60 days of priority technical support</strong> and unlimited revisions during the initial development phase. Hanei JP does not guarantee specific search engine rankings (SEO) or specific financial outcomes/ROI.</p>

      <h2 class="text-slate-900 dark:text-white">9. Termination</h2>
      <p>Hanei JP reserves the right to refuse service or terminate an active project if the Client provides misleading information, engages in illegal activities, or fails to communicate within a 30-day window.</p>

      <h2 class="text-slate-900 dark:text-white">10. Governing Law</h2>
      <p>These terms are governed by the laws of Japan. Any disputes arising from these terms shall be settled in the jurisdiction of the studio's primary operations.</p>

    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
